@startuml 20_seq_agent_report
actor "Agent" as Agent
participant "FastAPI /reports" as API
participant "Token validator" as Auth
participant "Metrics repository" as DB
participant "Host registry" as Host
Agent -> API : POST report + bearer token
API -> Auth : resolve host(token)
Auth --> API : host identity
API -> API : validate sample and bounds
API -> DB : save metric and process snapshot
DB --> API : committed
API -> Host : update lastSeenAt(receive time)
Host --> API : saved
API --> Agent : 202 Accepted
@enduml
